m-inline><div class="form-group w1 hide"><select name=ctl00$ext/widgets/search/search.ascx_side1_bottom_widgets$kind id=ctl00_ext/widgets/search/search.ascx_side1_bottom_widgets_kind class=form-control><option value="">分類列表</select></div><div class="form-group w2"><input name=ctl00$ext/widgets/search/search.ascx_side1_bottom_widgets$kw type=text id=ctl00_ext/widgets/search/search.ascx_side1_bottom_widgets_kw class=form-control placeholder=請輸入關鍵字> <a id=ctl00_ext/widgets/search/search.ascx_side1_bottom_widgets_searchButton class="btn btn-primary" href="javascript:__doPostBack('ctl00$ext/widgets/search/search.ascx_side1_bottom_widgets$searchButton','')">產品搜尋</a></div></div></div><div class="wid wid-about"><div class=h3><button type=button class="btn side-toggle"> <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-down"></span> <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-up"></span> </button></div><div class=nav itemscope itemtype=http://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement></div></div></div><div class="wrp-deco bottom"></div></aside><main id=ctl00_content class="content col-sm-9"><ol class="breadcrumb hidden-xs"></ol><div class=eZShareBar><div class="shareList hidden-print"><a class="fb item" href="javascript:shareTo('fb')"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a> <a class="twitter item" href="javascript:shareTo('twitter')"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a> <a class="line item" href="javascript:shareTo('line')"><i class="fab fa-line"></i></a> <a class="mial item isToggle" href="javascript:shareTo('mial')"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></a> <button class="link item isToggle" type=button data-clipboard-text="https://uknownews.com/page/article/show.aspx?num=7877"><i class="fas fa-link"></i></button> <a class="add item" href=javascript:toggle()> <i class="fas fa-plus icona"></i> <i class="fas fa-minus iconm"></i> </a></div></div><style>.eZShareBar .shareList{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap}.eZShareBar .item{width:33px;height:33px;background:#ddd;font-size:23px;color:#fff;border:none;outline:none;box-shadow:none;margin:2px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center}.eZShareBar .item.add.open .iconm,.eZShareBar .item.add .icona{display:block}.eZShareBar .item.add.open .icona,.eZShareBar .item.add .iconm{display:none}.eZShareBar .item:hover{opacity:0.8}.eZShareBar .item.isToggle{display:none}.eZShareBar .item.isToggle.open{display:flex}.eZShareBar .item.fb{background:#4267b2}.eZShareBar .item.twitter{background:#1da1f2}.eZShareBar .item.line{background:#1bb71f}.eZShareBar .item.pinterest{background:#bd081c}.eZShareBar .item.mial{background:#666}.eZShareBar .item.print{background:#444}.eZShareBar .item.link{background:#555}</style><script src=https://www.uknownews.com/js/clipboard.js-master/dist/clipboard.min.js></script><script>var thisUrl="https://uknownews.com/page/article/show.aspx?num=7877";var windowSize="height=500,width=600"
var thisTitle=document.title;var clipboard=new Clipboard('.eZShareBar .link');clipboard.on('success',function(e){alert("Copy: "+e.text);e.clearSelection();});function shareTo(target){switch(target){case"fb":window.open('http://www.facebook.com/share.php?u='.concat(encodeURIComponent(thisUrl)),'',config=windowSize);break;case"twitter":window.open('http://twitter.com/home/?status='.concat(encodeURIComponent(document.title)).concat(' ').concat(encodeURIComponent(thisUrl)),'',config=windowSize);break;case"line":window.open('https://lineit.line.me/share/ui?url='+encodeURIComponent(thisUrl)+'&text='+encodeURIComponent(document.title),'_blank',config=windowSize);break;case"mial":window.location="mailto:?subject="+thisTitle+"&body="+thisTitle+thisUrl,'',config=windowSize;break;case"print":window.print();break;}}
function toggle(){$(".eZShareBar .isToggle").toggleClass("open");$(".eZShareBar .item.add").toggleClass("open");}</script><div class=article_box><div class=article_h3>媒體議員陳治雄鼓勵愛女陳思妤接棒</div><div class=meta-info-wrapper><div class=meta-info><time datetime="2026/04/14 23:41:00">2026/04/14 23:41</time><div class=source>桃竹苗特派員 何高祿∕報導</div></div></div><div class=article_main><div class=article_showpic><div id=ctl00_content_holder_illubox class=art_sh_pic_box><img id=ctl00_content_holder_pic src=../../upload/article/202604142344360.jpg style=border-width:0></div><div class=title>陳思妤服務熱忱樂觀進取     何高祿攝</div></div><div class=edt_cont_pic_wrap><div class=article_showpic></div><div class=article_showpic></div><div class=article_showpic></div><div class=article_showpic></div></div><div class="article_word editor">新竹市記者公會前理事長陳治雄，轉戰民代新竹市議員深耕基層倍受好評，希望把這股服務熱忱持續加溫一脈相傳，經過三年多培植，自幼熱心助人，喜好打抱不平的愛女陳思妤，已經展現可圈可點關切民隱力道，常代父出征贏得掌聲和串串佳評。<br> 陳思妤求學其間，相當認真自立，求學其間參加不少社團服務學習，以優異成績畢業於聖約翰科技大學。不過陳思妤近年來服務人群，展現可圈可點好評，也非偶然。<br> 在2022年大選後，陳治雄就希望女兒，準備承接第二代的服務責任。陳思妤順從父意接受承擔責任，先選擇到公部門歷練，進入新竹縣政府教育局服務，實際參與並熟悉公部門運作，深入了解教育體系。<br> 雖然服務地點不在參選的新竹市，但在新竹縣歷練，反而讓她拓展了不同視野與經驗。當階段性任務告一段落後，回到新竹市，投入民代實務，到處跑場關切人群和地方事務。<br> 許多人問她：「思妤，妳還要繼續走這條服務、參選的路嗎？」她答案是肯定的。陳思妤說，地方上仍有許多對里民的承諾尚未完成，例如大鵬新城地下室漏水問題、延平地下停車場等長期關注的案件；多年累積的熟悉感、服務默契，以及兩代之間深厚的情誼，都是我無法放下的責任。但真正支撐我走下去的，是我的孩子。<br> 陳思妤說，我希望有一天，能像我的父親一樣，當孩子走在路上，會有不認識的人對他說：「你媽媽很好，她曾經幫了我們○○○的忙，謝謝她。」起初，以為這樣的話或許只是客套寒暄。但隨著我走進不同的地方、不同社團，聽到來自各個族群聲音，我才真正明白，原來父親在還不是議員之前，就已經認識並協助過這麼多的人。這一句「謝謝」，並不是理所當然，而是父親用四十年的時間深耕新竹、一步一腳印累積而來。<br> 決定參選新竹市西區市議員的陳思妤強調，這條路上還有很長一段要走，相信只要堅持服務的初心，也能跟父親一樣，走出屬於自己的腳步。<br> <br> &nbsp;</div><div class=keyword_box></div><div class="advertising_box mobile-avert"><ul><li><a id=ctl00_content_holder_side_advertising_mobile_HyperLink1 target="" href="https://www.facebook.com/PenghuFresh/?ti=as"><img id=ctl00_content_holder_side_advertising_mobile_Image1 class="img-responsive center-block big-pic" alt="" src=../../upload/banner/202207161836410.jpg style=border-width:0><img id=ctl00_content_holder_side_advertising_mobile_Image2 class="img-responsive center-block small-pic" alt="" src=../../upload/banner/202207161836410.jpg style=border-width:0></a></ul></div><div class=popin-recommend><div class="section-title t09">也許您會感興趣</div><div class="article_Rmain col-md-4"><a id=ctl00_content_holder_article_show_articleRepeater_ctl00_itemLink class=d-block href="show.aspx?num=3125"><div id=ctl00_content_holder_article_show_articleRepeater_ctl00_picPanel1 class=b_pic><img id=ctl00_content_holder_article_show_articleRepeater_ctl00_pic class=img-responsive src="../../app_script/DisplayCut.ashx?file=202401242326570.jpg&amp;rootDir=upload/article/&amp;w=640&amp;h=480" style=border-width:0></div><div class=article_h2>竹市自由車運動場全面美容將呈獻嶄新環境</div></a></div><div class="article_Rmain col-md-4"><a id=ctl00_content_holder_article_show_articleRepeater_ctl01_itemLink class=d-block href="show.aspx?num=2152"><div id=ctl00_content_holder_article_show_articleRepeater_ctl01_picPanel1 class=b_pic><img id=ctl00_content_holder_article_show_articleRepeater_ctl01_pic class=img-responsive src="../../app_script/DisplayCut.ashx?file=202307212302140.jpg&amp;rootDir=upload/article/&amp;w=640&amp;h=480" style=border-width:0></div><div class=article_h2>竹市茄苳景觀大道周邊4大路口即日至26路面刨鋪</div></a></div><div class="article_Rmain col-md-4"><a id=ctl00_content_holder_article_show_articleRepeater_ctl02_itemLink class=d-block href="show.aspx?num=5434"><div id=ctl00_content_holder_article_show_articleRepeater_ctl02_picPanel1 class=b_pic><img id=ctl00_content_holder_article_show_articleRepeater_ctl02_pic class=img-responsive src="../../app_script/DisplayCut.ashx?file=202411021900100.jpg&amp;rootDir=upload/article/&amp;w=640&amp;h=480" style=border-width:0></div><div class=article_h2>香山濕地富有海洋保育多元魅力</div></a></div></div><div class="advertising_box mobile-avert"><ul><li><a id=ctl00_content_holder_side_advertising_mobile1_HyperLink1 target="" href="https://utrip88.com/h/DataDetail?key=3551798886&amp;cont=266276"